--- WHAT SHIPPED (8 files, established feature-view multi-file pattern) -------------
  OperationsSection.Adapter.swift   (268 ln) models (NotificationStatsSnapshot,
        NotificationLogItem, AuditLogItem) + delivery-status classification (web
        getStatusIcon/statusTextClass) + formatters number/int/percent/dateTime (ports
        of numberFormat.ts + dateFormat.ts) + success-rate derivation + channel summary
        + a11y builders. Pure (no store/bundle/view).
  OperationsSection.Model.swift     (319 ln) P1/S11 telemetry seam, connection axis,
        input snapshot, resolved + projection, P1/S8 source seam + in-memory source,
        @Observable model (stale one-shot auto-refresh), P1/S10 strings facade.
  OperationsSection.swift           (171 ln) main View: bespoke accordion chrome
        (bell icon/title/description/success-rate badge/chevron) + freshness toolbar +
        phase switch. surfaceSlug = "OperationsSection".
  OperationsSection.Views.swift     (335 ln) header badge, freshness chip + banner,
        delivery block (stat-card grid + success radial gauge + recent-notifications
        table | empty states) + audit block (table | EmptyState), loading + error chrome.
  OperationsSection.Tables.swift    (186 ln) notification-log TSDataTable (status·title·
        message·time) + audit TSDataTable (time·action·resource·details) + comparators.
  OperationsSection.Previews.swift  (148 ln) data / logs-empty / stats-empty / loading /
        error / stale / offline previews (DEBUG).
  OperationsSection.strings         (i18n) table "OperationsSection": every web t() key
        + native chrome (description, freshness/empty/error copy, accordion a11y).
  OperationsSection.Tests.swift     (399 ln) 8 suites / 37 tests.

  States reproduced (no hidden surface): loading (web two-skeleton h-32 over h-48) ·
  ready (delivery block — stats → 4 metric cards + success radial gauge + recent-
  notifications table, or the web "No data available" / "No recent notifications" empty,
  the section is never hidden — over the audit block — table or the web "No audit log
  entries" EmptyState) · error (QueryError peer + retry) · stale + offline (freshness
  chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the stale transition).

  Data binding: the three web polling useQuery feeds (notification stats 15s,
  notification logs 15s, audit logs 30s) coalesce into one `OperationsInput` pushed by
  the P1/S8 `OperationsSource` seam; the view performs zero networking.

